{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minesweeper game where you can use your magical abilities to deal with pesky odds. Save your concentration resource to speed up the process or get rid of tiebreakers. Mine your way through without disturbing the spirits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mine is haunted by all the lost souls that were buried there. It will take a toll on your sanity to stay in these tunnels for too long, and it's difficult to stay focused on your task when your mind is being clawed at. Good thing you know how to handle those spirits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your sanity decreasing by the second, you can't afford to waste time with obvious mining that will drain your focus and put you at risk of making speedy mistakes. Use your Cascade spell to speed up the trivial mining!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979240/extras/f2470b918da5af90e3fe4e7249e357ab.poster.avif?t=1774704439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979240/extras/f2470b918da5af90e3fe4e7249e357ab.webm?t=1774704439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979240/extras/f2470b918da5af90e3fe4e7249e357ab.mp4?t=1774704439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not let probabilities ruin your progress. Use your Seer spell to remove bad luck out of the equation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979240/extras/c770a19fdd047d0d3746bd31d661bf25.poster.avif?t=1774704439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979240/extras/c770a19fdd047d0d3746bd31d661bf25.webm?t=1774704439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979240/extras/c770a19fdd047d0d3746bd31d661bf25.mp4?t=1774704439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through the mine, clear increasingly difficult levels. Use your powers to get obstacles out of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The odds are in your favor now. You are the minesweeper. Do not let the mine sweep you!<br><br><strong>Source available under a custom license \u2013 Buying supports development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: the full source code of this game will be publicly released under a custom license. More details are available on the developer\u2019s website. Purchasing the game primarily helps support the development of future games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979240?t=1774704439","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979240?t=1774704439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979240/f6dbaa65f087d49739063d75a8bb2f13860dbb8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774704439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979240/f6dbaa65f087d49739063d75a8bb2f13860dbb8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774704439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4244360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minesweeper game where you can use your magical abilities to deal with pesky odds. Save your conce